    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの子……\r\nずいぶん真剣に何かを見てるな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（横顔でもわかる、まっすぐな眼だ……\r\n見ていると、引き込まれるような……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すみません、ちょっといいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "はい、なんですかっ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに真剣に、何を見ていたんですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "わっ、真剣だなんて……ちょっと恥ずかしいです\r\nこれ、大好きなアニメのポスターなんです！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（『魔女っ娘アイドルミラクル♡ミラージュ』……\r\n小学生くらいの女の子向けかな）",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "とっても素敵なアニメなんですよ♪\r\nどの子もとっても可愛くて……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あ……ごめんなさい、お兄さん\r\nふゆ、ついつい夢中になってしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "そういえば、ふゆに何かご用事ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "mask_take",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 5000,
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（初対面の人が相手でも、全然物怖じしない性格\r\nそれになんと言っても笑顔が可愛らしい）",
    "charAnim3": "mask_off",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いえ、こちらこそ突然すみません\r\n用事と言いますか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "私は、２８３プロダクションという芸能事務所で\r\nプロデューサーをしている者です",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルに、興味はありませんか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それって、つまり……スカウトってやつですか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい\r\nあなたの笑顔に、強く惹かれました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "興味……\r\nない……わけじゃ、ないです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……でも、その前にひとつ、教えてほしいことがあります",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "──本当に、ふゆがアイドルになれると思いますか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "アイドルって、とっても魅力的な女の子だけがなれる\r\nきっと、そんな特別な存在だって思うんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "可愛くて、かっこよくて、キラキラしてて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010140,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "──ふゆとは正反対の女の子ばかり",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010150,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……ふゆが、そんな女の子に……\r\nそんなアイドルに、なれると思いますか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nそう思ったから、声をかけたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010160,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010170,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……だったら",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010180,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ふゆ、アイドルやってみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほ、本当ですか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "はい！　ふゆは、黛冬優子って言います\r\n『ふゆ』って呼んでください",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800002/1018001010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018001010200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん\r\nこれからふゆのこと、よろしくお願いしますっ",
